{
  "title": "Ziyaarat-e-Jaamea'h Sagheerah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اَوْلِیَآءِ اللهِ وَ اَصْفِیَآئِهٖ \nPeace be on the sincere adherents of Allah, who are also His exceptional favourites, \nASSALAAMO A’LAA AWLEYAAA-ILLAAHE WA ASFEYAAA-EHI \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اُمَنَآءِ اللهِ وَ اَحِبَّآئِهٖ \nPeace be on the trustees of Allah, who are also His dearest friends.\nASSALAAMO A'LAA OMANAAA-IL LAAHE WA AHIBBAAA-EHI \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی اَنْصَارِ اللهِ وَ خُلَفَآئِهٖ \nPeace be on the supporters of Allah, who are also His representatives.\nASSALAAMO A'LAA ANSAARIL LAAHE WA KHOLAFAAA-EHI \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی مَحَآلِّ مَعْرِفَۃِ اللهِ\nPeace be on the medium of the awareness of Allah.\nASSALAAMO A'LAA MAHAAALLE MAA'-REFATIL LAAHE \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی مَسَاكِنِ ذِكْرِ اللهِ\nPeace be on the centre of the remembrance of Allah.\nASSALAAMO A'LAA MASAAKENE ZIKRIL LAAHE \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰی مُظْهِرِیْ اَمْرِ اللّٰهِ وَ نَهْیِهٖ \nPeace be on (you) who make clear His lawful and unlawful.\nASSALAAMO A'LAA MUZHEREE AMRIL LAAHE WA NAHYEHI \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الدُّعَاۃِ اِلَی اللّٰهِ\nPeace be on (you) who invite mankind unto Allah.\nASSALAAMO A'LAD DO-A'ATE ELAL LAAHE \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْمُسْتَقِرِّیْنَ فِیْ مَرْضَاۃِ اللّٰهِ\nPeace be on (you) who occupy and supervise the centre through which Allah’s pleasure is routed.\nASSALAAMO A'LAL MUSTAQIRREENA FEE MARZAATIL LAAHE \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْمُخْلِصِیْنَ فِیْ طَاعَۃِ اللّٰهِ\nPeace be on (you) who truly obey and serve Allah.\nASSALAAMO A'LAL MUKHLESEENA FEE TAA-A'TIL LAAHE \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الْاَدِلَّآءِ عَلَی اللّٰهِ\nPeace be on (you) who show the right path leading unto Allah.\nASSALAAMO A'LAL A-DILLAAA-E A'LAL LAAHE \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَی الَّذِیْنَ مَنْ وَ الَاهُمْ فَقَدْ وَالَی اللهَ\nPeace be on (you) whom whoso befriends, in fact, makes friends with Allah, \nASSALAAMO A'LAL LAZEENA MAN WAALAAHUM FAQAD WAALAL LAAHA \nوَ مَنْ عَادَاهُمْ فَقَدْ عَادَی اللهَ \nwhom whoso opposes, in fact, runs counter to Allah, \nWA MAN A'ADAAHUM FAQAD A'ADAL LAAHA \nوَ مَنْ عَرَفَهُمْ فَقَدْ عَرَفَ اللهَ \nwhom whoso understands, in fact, recognises Allah,\nWA MAN A'RAFAHUM FAQAD A'RAFAL LAAHA \nوَ مَنْ جَهِلَهُمْ فَقَدْ جَهِلَ اللهَ\nwhom whoso passes over, in fact, ignores Allah, \nWA MAN JAHELAHUM FAQAD JAHELAL LAAHA \nوَ مَنِ اعْتَصَمَ بِهِمْ فَقَدِ اعْتَصَمَ بِاللّٰهِ\nwhom whoso defends, in fact, supports Allah,\nWA MANE'-TASAMA BEHIM FAQADE'-TASAMA BILLAAHE \nوَ مَنْ تَخَلّٰی مِنْهُمْ فَقَدْ تَخَلّٰی مِنَ اللهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ \nwhom whoso deserts, in fact, abandons the Almighty Allah.\nWA MAN TAKHALLAA MINHUM FAQAD TAKHALLAA MENAL LAAHE A'ZZA WA JALLA \nوَاُشْهِدُ اللهَ اَنِّیْ سِلْمٌ لِمَنْ سَالَمْتُمْ \nI request Allah to vouch for me that I make peace with those who are at peace with you, \nWA USH-HEDUL LAAHA ANNEE SILMUN LEMAN SAALAMTUM \nوَ حَرْبٌ لِمَنْ حَارَبْتُمْ مُؤْمِنٌ بِسِرِّكُمْ وَعَلَانِیَتِكُمْ \nI make war upon those who declare war on you, I believe in that which is concealed and in that which is evident concerning you, \nWA HARBUN LEMAN HAARABTUM MOMENUN BE-SIRREKUM WA A'LAANEYATEKUM \nمُفَوِّضٌ فِیْ ذٰلِكَ كُلِّهٖ اِلَیْكُمْ \nI give total control of my affairs in your hands.\nMOFAWWEZUN FEE ZAALEKA KULLEHI ELAYKUM\nلَعَنَ اللهُ عَدُوَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ مِنَ الْجِنِّ وَالْاِنْسِ \nMay Allah curse the enemies of Progeny of Muhammad, be they jinn or men, \nLA-A'NAL LAAHO A'DUWWA AALE MOHAMMADIN MENAL JINNE WAL INSE \nوَ اَبْرَءُ اِلَی اللّٰهِ مِنْهُمْ وَ صَلَّی اللهٌ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِهٖ.\nI disconnect all links with them and turn to Allah, and Allah's blessings be on Muhammad and on his children.\nWA ABRA-O WA SALLALLAAHO A'LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI"
}
